OL,3,GNEWSABrain health clinic aims to
OL,4,A'transform' dementia care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brain health clinic seeking to
OL,7,F"transform" how dementia is diagnosed,
OL,8,Fslowed down and treated has opened on
OL,9,FWorld Alzheimer's Day.
OL,11,FThe Manchester Brain Health Centre
OL,12,F(MBHC) is located at Manchester Royal
OL,13,FInfirmary.
OL,15,FThe first clinic of its kind in the UK,
OL,16,FMBHC is bringing together
OL,17,Fpsychiatrists, vascular specialists and
OL,18,Facademics under a single service to
OL,19,Fidentify and treat memory loss earlier.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
