OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABrain health clinic aims to
OL,4,A'transform' dementia care
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Right now, the system is not set up
OL,7,Ffor people when memory and thinking
OL,8,Fproblems first appear," said Dr Ross
OL,9,FDunne, dementia research lead at
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Mental Health NHS
OL,11,FFoundation Trust. "That is exactly when
OL,12,Fearly diagnosis and treatment could
OL,13,Fhave the greatest impact."
